{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"5ea2c3ce-bea8-4ce3-8195-f1f0f2991204","agentId":"a943432bf960b6017","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Beam search / IDA* / 现代 heuristic search 变体在大规模组合问题上的应用，特别是 placement 类。\n\n**背景：** Round 1-7 主要研究 CP-SAT / SAT / LBBD 等\"完整搜索\"框架。但 heuristic search 圈有大量\"近似但快速\"的工具——Beam search、IDA*、SMA*、bidirectional search 等。看是否能作 anytime warm-start。\n\n**调研重点：**\n1. Beam search 现代变体（Diverse Beam Search、Stochastic Beam）\n2. IDA* / RBFS / SMA* 学术状态\n3. Bounded Beam Search for combinatorial optimization\n4. 跟 LNS 的关系\n5. ML-guided beam search（neural beam）\n6. Beam search 在 NP-hard 实例上的 competitive ratio\n7. 实施工具：fairseq beam、专用 search lib\n8. 我们项目用 beam search 找 incumbent 给 CP-SAT 当 hint 的可行性\n9. 跟 RINS / ALNS 的对比\n10. 工程量\n\n**输出格式（不超过 1000 字）：**\n- 主要 search variant 横向对比\n- 跟我们 placement 的契合度\n- 末尾\"是否值得作 ALNS 之外的 warm-start 备选\"\n\n要具体到 search 算法 + 工程库。"},"uuid":"642cf556-0c13-423f-89d6-3011ddd3349e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:01:58.597Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
